<a href="text://<font color=#89D2E8><header>Help (aggdef)<end>

<header2>'aggdef' command<end>
<tab>Find out where to set your aggdef slider to be 1/1
<tab><highlight>!aggdef &lt;attack time&gt; &lt;recharge time&gt; &lt;init value&gt;<end>

If you are lazy, just use
<tab><highlight>!weapon &lt;drop weapon into chat&gt;<end>

Example:
<tab>Your weapon has an attack time of <highlight>1.2<end> seconds and a recharge time of <highlight>1.5<end> seconds.
<tab>Your melee/ranged init is <highlight>1200<end>:
<tab><a href='chatcmd:///tell Nadybot !aggdef 1.2 1.5 1200'>/tell Nadybot !aggdef 1.2 1.5 1200</a>

<i>See <a href='chatcmd:///tell Nadybot !help syntax'>!help syntax</a> for an explanation of the command syntax</i>">Help (aggdef)</a>
